Bu depo hicbir video icerigi barindirmaz veya yeniden yayinlamaz. Yalnizca
herkese acik kaynaklardan derlenen yayin adreslerini dogrular ve listeler.
Kanallarin telif hakki ilgili yayincilara aittir.

This repository hosts no video content. It only validates and indexes stream
addresses collected from publicly available sources. All channel content
remains the property of its respective broadcasters.
